 "lines": [
  {
   "text": "Some time later Joash resolved",
   "heard": 4,
   "words": 5,
   "error_s": 0.13,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "To restore the house of the LORD",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 0.67,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "He gathered priests and Levites",
   "heard": 5,
   "words": 5,
   "error_s": 0.33,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "To collect money from all Israel",
   "heard": 6,
   "words": 6,
   "error_s": 0.16,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "But they did not act quickly",
   "heard": 6,
   "words": 6,
   "error_s": 0.31,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "The chief priest asked for the tax",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 0.72,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Laid down by Moses in the wilderness",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 0.72,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "For the tent of the testimony",
   "heard": 6,
   "words": 6,
   "error_s": 0.72,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "They made a chest at the gate",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 0.05,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "And the people dropped their silver in",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 0.3,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "All the officials rejoiced",
   "heard": 4,
   "words": 4,
   "error_s": 0.19,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "And the chest was filled to the brim",
   "heard": 8,
   "words": 8,
   "error_s": 0.42,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Stonecutters and carpenters worked",
   "heard": 3,
   "words": 4,
   "error_s": 0.35,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "To restore the original design",
   "heard": 5,
   "words": 5,
   "error_s": 0.2,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "The workmen labored day by day",
   "heard": 6,
   "words": 6,
   "error_s": 0.15,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "And the house of God was made whole",
   "heard": 8,
   "words": 8,
   "error_s": 0.35,
   "tie_split": true,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Athaliah had broken in",
   "heard": 4,
   "words": 4,
   "error_s": 0.79,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "And used sacred things for Baal",
   "heard": 5,
   "words": 6,
   "error_s": 0.78,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Now the king commanded repair",
   "heard": 5,
   "words": 5,
   "error_s": 0.75,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "And the work went forward",
   "heard": 5,
   "words": 5,
   "error_s": 0.79,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "The Levites carried the chest",
   "heard": 5,
   "words": 5,
   "error_s": 0.76,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "To the king\u2019s officers each day",
